# Override .gitignore for gcloud source uploads. The Dockerfile expects
# configs/ and .env at build time; .gitignore excludes them (correct for git),
# but gcloud needs them in the build context. Without this file, gcloud falls
# back to .gitignore and silently skips configs/, causing the container to
# fail to start.

# Things we DO want to keep out of the build context:
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
.idea/
.DS_Store
sbs-drafts-api
